    {
      "text": "Line chart “DA. 4.6 – BCG, DTPcv and measles-containing vaccine coverage (%) in children under 1 year”, 2015–2019, with lines for BCG, DTPcv-1, DTPcv-3 and MCV1 coverage. BCG and DTPcv-1 stay around 95%; DTPcv-3 falls from about 97% to about 87% by 2017 and then levels off; MCV1 declines gradually from about 91% to about 84%.",
